<view class="page {{themeClass}}"><view class="card"><view class="title">技师服务分工</view><view class="hint">选择技师实际能提供的项目。保存后预约时才会出现在这些项目的技师列表中；不改变已预约记录或排班。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!technicians.length}}" class="hint">暂无在职技师，请先在员工管理中新增或核对在职状态。</view><block wx:else><picker range="{{technicians}}" range-key="name" value="{{ti}}" bindchange="chooseTech" disabled="{{saving}}"><view class="choice">{{technicians[ti].name}} · 更换技师 ›</view></picker><view class="choice" wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle" role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{item.checked}}"><text>{{item.checked ? '☑' : '□'}} {{item.name}}{{item.isActive ? '' : '（已下架）'}}</text></view><button bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !dirty}}">保存服务分工</button></block></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="hint">{{error}}<button bindtap="load" disabled="{{saving}}">重新加载</button></view></view></view>
